      "message": "These responses were previously used for other disconnect causes... are we sure this is not a carrier specific issue where we need to map BAD_REQUEST/REDIRECTED for orange to SERVER_ERROR but CODE_SIP_BAD_REQUEST should be mapped to INCOMING_AUTO_REJECTED for others?",
